Set a task to update

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Set a task to update

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  InitGroup: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
task = Null;
{
  Button["Start", If[task =!= Null, Return[]];
    task = SetInterval[
      board = CellularAutomaton["GameOfLife", board, {{1}}] // First;
    , 50]
  ],
  Button["Stop", If[task === Null, Return[]];
    TaskRemove[task];
    task = Null;
  ]
} // Row 

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
:::note
Do not forget to stop the animation before closing a notebook
:::

